canon/THE_DOCUMENT_LAW.md :: RESULTS.md :: the observation-result genre filename; §1.8 states the live genre is empty
canon/THE_DOCUMENT_LAW.md :: evidence/observations/ :: named as the archived location; the live genre is empty by §1.8

# `.agents/COMMUNE/` needs no entry: it resolves in the frozen laboratory at a07ff376, and
# `/tmp/codex-clipboard-T9jMYB.png` needs none either — an absolute path outside this repository
# is not a claim about this tree.

